<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch unadjusted unemployment rises in Jun-Aug.</title>
<headline>Dutch unadjusted unemployment rises in Jun-Aug.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch non-seasonally adjusted unemployment rose to an average of 433,000 in June-August from 414,000 in May-July, the Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said.</p>
</text>
